`benchmark.meta description: Repeatedly reads and replaces immutable pairs in a canonical Array.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: compile-timing

/core/array

. values = Array'Pair(1024) • with Pair(each, each + 1)
. checksum Size = 0
for index in 0 .. < 50000000
    . slot = index % values.length
    . value = values[slot]
    values[slot] = Pair(value.y, value.x + 1)
    checksum += (value.x + value.y) as Size

-- "bench-result array/tuple-index-access checksum=$checksum"

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Pair is Tuple

+ x Int
+ y Int
